{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>高露潔聖誕牙膏買6支送翻蓋式迷你相機，每單限送1次，數量有限，活動至12月9日前。</p>\n<p>HKTVmall 官方帖文公布，高露潔聖誕牙膏買 6 支即送翻蓋式迷你相機。每張訂單限送 1 次，贈品先到先得，送完即止；活動至 12 月 9 日前，結帳前請核對商品頁及即時供應。</p>\n<h2>換領條件</h2>\n<p>在 HKTVmall 購買指定高露潔聖誕牙膏 6 支，可獲贈翻蓋式迷你相機 1 部。詳情以 HKTVmall 官方購買頁及活動條款為準：https://shorturl.at/DiupU</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T04:49:55.506778+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":231,"images":0,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T04:28:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T05:03:52.340503+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T04:43:31.575668+00:00","content_hash":"a761776694506d232e91f078da5a880dd05d0dc0b7082fe69f21155e5192e434","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}